# Trivy exemptions for the cube image scan.
#
# RULES OF ENGAGEMENT (PR-S1):
#   - Each entry MUST have a one-line justification on the comment above it.
#   - Each entry MUST have a `# expires: YYYY-MM-DD` line, after which the
#     scan-fail behavior re-triggers and forces a re-evaluation. Six months
#     is the default; shorter for "wait for upstream patch" cases.
#   - Vulnerability IDs use Trivy's preferred form: CVE-YYYY-NNNN or
#     GHSA-... or DLA-...; one ID per line.
#
# Empty by design — the image inherits debian:bookworm-slim's surface
# only. Add entries as findings appear in CI; do NOT pre-populate.
